WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.299
The water was cold.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.277
Mole could not swim!

3
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:09.360
"How stupid of me!" Mole thought.

4
00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:12.830
He started to sink.

5
00:00:12.831 --> 00:00:18.965
Just in time, a paw grabbed Mole’s fur.

6
00:00:18.966 --> 00:00:24.421
Whoosh ! Mole’s head popped above the

7
00:00:24.422 --> 00:00:28.088
waves. "Oh!" gasped

8
00:00:28.089 --> 00:00:30.865
Mole. "I’ve got you," said

9
00:00:30.866 --> 00:00:32.898
Rat. "You’ll be all

10
00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:37.405
right." He pulled Mole to

11
00:00:37.406 --> 00:00:42.216
shore. "Rat, I am very sorry," said

12
00:00:42.217 --> 00:00:45.319
Mole. "Don’t worry about it," laughed

13
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.985
Rat. "What’s a little water to a Water

14
00:00:48.986 --> 00:00:55.054
Rat?" He pulled the boat to

15
00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:58.496
shore. They stepped into the boat

16
00:00:58.497 --> 00:01:03.794
again. This time Mole sat quietly on his

17
00:01:03.795 --> 00:01:08.003
cushion. Rat took the oars and

18
00:01:08.004 --> 00:01:13.132
rowed. "We’ll be home soon," said Rat.

19
00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:18.072
Rat’s home was a very cozy place.

20
00:01:18.073 --> 00:01:22.287
Its shelves were full of books.

21
00:01:22.288 --> 00:01:25.222
"Sit down and warm up," said Rat.

22
00:01:25.223 --> 00:01:29.212
"I will light a bright fire."

23
00:01:29.213 --> 00:01:33.469
"Ah-choo!" Mole sneezed.

24
00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:37.483
"Here are slippers and a robe," said Rat.

25
00:01:37.484 --> 00:01:39.756
"Put them on, Mole."

26
00:01:39.757 --> 00:01:44.294
Together they ate a fine supper.

27
00:01:44.295 --> 00:01:48.140
Then Rat sat with Mole by the fire.

28
00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:52.966
Rat loved to write songs and poems.

29
00:01:52.967 --> 00:01:57.692
He told Mole many stories of the river.

30
00:01:57.693 --> 00:02:00.940
"You should stay with me," said Rat.

31
00:02:00.941 --> 00:02:04.155
"I’ll teach you to row and swim."

32
00:02:04.156 --> 00:02:07.060
"Thank you, Ratty," said Mole.

33
00:02:07.061 --> 00:02:13.384
"You are a good friend!"

